  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hSnEj48k\">如你未查看过 【快速入门】，请先查看该文档，快速入门将用几个简单的小例子帮你快速了解什么是脚本</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-vMTNk2MF\">本文档将围绕脚本本身的机制和具体限制展开说明</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-GY23S5ie\"><strong>轻代码工具使用反馈群</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Snsozx49\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/ba5a45b3e01748ad837bbee7ca59f216~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2023856309&amp;x-signature=NT7ChBmLSWO9sjxkgMV4VfKHUdQ%3D\" data-auto=\"false\" style=\"width: 278px; visibility: visible; height: 277px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-2TY9DH7N\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-2TY9DH7N\">脚本的底层机制</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZasLpSVR\">脚本的语言采用JavaScript，支持 ES6，你只需掌握 JavaScript 的入门级知识即可开始编写，内置的 IDE 可帮助语法突出显示、自动填充。同时我们封装了大量的预定义的类和方法，可以简洁快速地访问</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-q7bYmE9r\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-I39hOLAv\">脚本基础架构基于巨量引擎Marketing API，但我们又本于「易用」，「简洁」 的设计原则，重新设计了脚本里面的方法，以帮助使用者用更简洁简短的代码编写有用的代码</p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-XbZhDNBl\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-XbZhDNBl\">能力范围</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-rW5ErXzi\">当前能力建设支持以下业务线</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-mGQiT42M\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-YB00O5Gl\"><col data-id=\"c24a306c-kEWeNETQ\" span=\"1\" width=\"25.369738339021612%\"><col data-id=\"c5729045-Z2HWB8WW\" span=\"1\" width=\"74.63026166097838%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-QMeUTBfR\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-9cf40m7j\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-fW48C65M\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-53U0AfSH\">业务</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-8N9LNQ3Z\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hTXioJ7i\">具体分支</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-8JLOSn7B\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-Qg7B8KFm\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QwWjDfXR\">巨量广告</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-jln8ClHk\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-fZBdL0LE\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iJlbjXif\">巨量方舟（代理商一站式）：<span style=\"background-color: #b7edb1;\"><strong>支持</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-le895nU1\">巨量工作台：暂不支持，敬请期待</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-n04XaTkX\">Dou+：暂不支持，敬请期待</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-6H6PkMBK\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-9YJXIciS\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hyTHzTSJ\">巨量千川</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-YPEo98lk\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XNpWRUvG\">暂不支持，敬请期待</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-EPaQ1MHh\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-caAc8XPp\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oO0c9PEn\">巨量星图</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-J57kUbRc\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vPhISPIP\">暂不支持，敬请期待</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-eJ8XjDR5\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"taa552b2-jBG6Od3W\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yuJU1f91\">企业号</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-2Ab9fTkJ\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qyazoxjL\">暂不支持，敬请期待</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-y4MbaKuf\">包括以下模块</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-RSSXYjld\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-X4aQKf1R\"><col data-id=\"c24a306c-84gR2HPX\" span=\"1\" width=\"25.369738339021612%\"><col data-id=\"c5729045-jDeKJJEP\" span=\"1\" width=\"74.63026166097838%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-cgeKCJKJ\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-IPTBja77\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-ViO6mh5C\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LeJzlsyD\">模块</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-G1UBNAaK\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-y9ATNs5u\">具体能力</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-O6gijpTl\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-XjAYQMfd\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qLGCAMaL\">账户关系拉取</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-DmiojSNA\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-U8gmbi2l\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XnGnCnAm\">基于一个登录用户拉取其所有可访问agent_id，与 </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bdJgAKBB\">基于一个agent_id拉取其所有adv，与 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710516003852\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">API - 代理商下账户拉取</a> 能力等价</li></ol></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-qgIf44RO\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-6SgiWcMr\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-k2Qy3YFg\">广告报表数据获取</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-2po6sBZJ\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-fEQf6C7J\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9m0JGGjD\">基于一个adv获取其全量数据报表，与 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1741387668314126\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">API  - 自定义报表 </a> 能力等价</li></ol></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-Wa6TWDS5\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-om06CgWe\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mpDEz8kL\">广告列表数据获取</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-2fTpCVLS\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-7CRhAhKB\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OTjGHeYc\">基于一个adv获取其全量升级版项目数据，与 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1740937147595776\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">API - 项目列表</a> 能力等价</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DQN6o401\">基于一个adv获取其全量升级版广告数据，与 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1741028841006095\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">API - 广告列表</a> 能力等价</li></ol></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-9Bu87MsF\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-kjL0dXkL\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bXZGmr6u\">账户余额数据获取</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-cpXPCdCi\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-BPLoSgUd\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NseDk3dO\">基于一个adv获取其账户余额数据，与  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710526192652\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">API - 账户余额</a> 能力等价</li></ol></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-qEU4udZZ\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"taa552b2-XihfXHj6\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uULFeG6g\">网络请求能力</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-WNC8caRA\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-04qUkIAb\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-COk4K4XD\">可以与外部服务器通信，比如代理商自身的服务器，或者一些公开服务，比如说发送飞书/钉钉/企业微信消息</li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-tV974nCW\">暂不支持的能力</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-3AkgeLbG\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-XgSHJSVG\"><col data-id=\"c24a306c-NBONa3bT\" span=\"1\" width=\"25.369738339021612%\"><col data-id=\"c5729045-Gb4VU4bD\" span=\"1\" width=\"74.63026166097838%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-F4Wh5O1V\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-kYZU8HLi\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"taa552b2-MlU4ZEd2\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-40Ap4hQa\">写功能</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-Q1GmYPPT\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4FlxOgNT\">即所有涉及到广告数据的读写功能，如修改出价，状态，预算，转账都暂不支持</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uJ4K8ke9\">将在下一季度支持</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-qZ1SB5g2\">没有你想要的模块和能力？我们正在持续补齐中，可以通过 XXX 联系我们并反馈意见</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-18pe8Avs\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-EDoRb49j\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-EDoRb49j\">脚本创建与运行</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-023UpEd2\" class=\"data-table\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-7gN67Q9o\"><col data-id=\"c24a306c-7PBfREhd\" span=\"1\" width=\"25.369738339021612%\"><col data-id=\"c5729045-cMljVIII\" span=\"1\" width=\"74.63026166097838%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-K4qgNEe7\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-GLC47UNs\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-7WeBFKK1\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mmdbtmin\">操作入口</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-7NnjGO8O\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5NCyldmo\">需要先行登录巨量方舟平台</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-BXmDyOwq\">当前脚本的操作入口在 巨量方舟 - 工具 - 轻代码工具 中</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-hIYKhPfk\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-SoGDDDpk\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PwzUSV2g\">新建脚本</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-8WTgbaoX\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iVdBhGFY\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/fb38b00c5b47484a8c7e60d517d94b1b~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417891&amp;x-signature=n3sAUew99yhUbtsnzcZKvKgKUSg%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ycddz1pR\">来到列表中，点击新建脚本，可以进入代码编辑器</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-Va1S6BZo\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-63x8YTdP\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O5PFI89M\">编辑代码</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-fdlHIw5d\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1Ga0FNS0\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/282bc6c7d7fe46e4bb26a1aec416112d~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2016417899&amp;x-signature=Js2xhcoRN5c%2FQ1yJJzC0EML1ga8%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RRD3Kg91\">在左侧代码编辑框可以进行代码编辑</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MCir73ZL\">可直接通过【示例代码】复制示例代码进行测试</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hL4TF1T7\">若自行编写，则具体语法说明可以参考 【<a href=\"https://qingzhou.bytedance.net/document/detail?docId=1781346929171465&amp;docLibId=1781346820953290&amp;spaceId=1730632186754063\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">基础概念与语法</a>】</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-kKpRlKTZ\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-YhLYFC6o\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ARCxCg3H\">设置运行规则与保存</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-ujPds7EW\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-P0kGOD51\">编辑代码后可以设置运行规则</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-esVlSStu\">具体规则说明可以查看【运行规则说明】</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0kwwp769\">设置完毕后，可以为脚本增加一个便于记忆的名称，然后点击保存进行保存</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-KJjOCYTt\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"tcaab6a0-5SuL6q7x\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vc2rJKxr\">确认运行协议</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tf78a3b8-h30nqrdB\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GxsLyqPT\">保存完毕后，代码依然不可允许，请点击【确认协议】对脚本完成运行确认</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-m7fNn0dm\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"taa552b2-lNFfUFC5\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gcvQMLIw\">运行</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1c6b3a2-MZJCjY7W\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-M3S5eoDq\">确认完毕后，可以点击左下角运行触发一次执行</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0t3w5ybs\">或者在设定的运行规则时间触发时，将自动进行一次运行</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-1aMJNstm\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-ISDVf9pT\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-ISDVf9pT\">运行限制</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-K8bPnJK1\">为了保障整个服务的稳定性，我们会对脚本的运行做如下的限制，请提前执行并在编程时尽可能避免限制的影响</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ps2GnmmV\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-N5WBbFuM\">脚本运行时间限制：30min</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ivt0o0Nc\">脚本的开始执行时间，当前无法指定具体的时间点，我们会尽量在所选时段范围内尽快的执行</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hMP2QMaE\">代码文件的大小我们限制在了 1MB</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IAB7Yu1g\">单条日志记录需要少于1w个字符；日志打印速率过快时会被限流（保持不变）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-m4n5XQnE\">内存限制，单脚本运行内存最大512M</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-owotjvre\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-6Egq0ZFd\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-6Egq0ZFd\">帮助与支持</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-ibYqg9eJ\">目前轻代码工具正在公测中，不论你是在</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-po0Xgegw\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-HcsM281l\">编写程序中遇到问题</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sFETyMZh\">阅读文档中发现错漏或者困惑之处</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SFdJkVwX\">发现自己需要的能力目前不支持</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-kbHmdOn0\">都可以加入轻代码工具使用反馈群，会有相关同学为您提供服务～</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-79fAXdb9\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/ba5a45b3e01748ad837bbee7ca59f216~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2023856309&amp;x-signature=NT7ChBmLSWO9sjxkgMV4VfKHUdQ%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible; width: 329px; height: 327px;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p></div>",
